(256, '2025-06-18', 'Fortführung "Grundlagen der Arbeitsorganisation". Grundlagen des Zeitmanagements. Aufbau eines "Umschulungskalenders". Beachtung der Leistungskurve bzw. der Konzentrationsspanne. ', '', 'Exkursion in die Bundeszentrale für Politische Bildung (von der GPB-Leitung genehmigt).'),
(256, '2025-06-19', 'Grundlagen des Wissenschaftlichen Arbeitens (Quellenarbeit: Zitate und Quellen korrekt angeben etc., etc.).  Auswahl der (wissenschaftlichen) Quellen. Professionell recherchieren. Exposé. Aufbau einer Hausarbeit. Powerpoint(präsentation). Einführung in die gelungene Präsentation (hier: Grundlagen vom "Augenkontakt" über "Handout" bis hin zu "Visualisierungen"', '', ''),
(256, '2025-06-20', 'Lernsysteme ("Lernen lernen" etc.). Aktives Lesen. Schaubilder und Mindmaps. Lernposter. Lernkartei. Lernort. Klausuren/Prüfungen systematisch vorbereiten (Vorgehensweise etc.).', '', ''),
(267, '2025-06-16', 'Networking Models of OSI and TCP/IP and their layers, // The TCP/IP ''s Model with its PDUs, Addressing, Devices and Protocols // Connection-Oriented mode with TCP and Connectionless mode with UDP// Introduction to IEEE 802 and IETF and the RFCs // Doing lab exercises together with Wireshark to describe the Encapsulation of ARP, TCP, UDP, ICMP with quiz about their Addressing and Data Units and Layers and Devices.', '', ''),
(267, '2025-06-17', 'Reading the RFC 8200 for IPv6 to understand the terminology used with IPv6, and security issues with IPv6 and how to protect the system. Learning about Ethernet and LAN at Layers 1+2, the Access Method called CSMA-CD and CSMA-CA for wireless, LAN devices, two standard frame types, ARP Tables, Routing Tables and Host Configuration Table and Testing the connection to the Gateway with Ping.', '', ''),
(267, '2025-06-18', 'Reading chapter 3 "Internet Protocol" together and Learning about IPv4 classful Addressing, the IP classes, the IP masks, the reserverd IP addresses, the private address ranges, the APIPA or Zero Configuration address, and How to calculate your Network ID, ', '', ''),
(267, '2025-06-19', ' Learning how to read IPv6 Addressing  from the RFC 4291 "IP Version 6 Addressing Architecture", Chapter 3 Understanding the fields in IPv4 Packets, Security Warning for IPv4 and protective measures, Internet Assigned Numbers Authority and the DNS system, Using Wireshark and group discussion of all of the above mentioned.', '', ''),
(267, '2025-06-20', 'Reviewing and discussing Ethernet LAN, IPv4 with ARP and IPv6 with NDP, and Security Considerations.\nLater the Test/ Klausur', '', ''),
