(397, '2025-08-19', 'Learning more of the official Scrum Guide, the accountabilities of the roles  on the Scrum team, The five events and Sprint charts like, Burn-Down charts, Learnin about Nexus for working with 2 or more teams on one Product Goal, Learning about Kanban for organising the workflow, Doing the open Assessments together and explaining the reasons for the answers, Learning the special vocabulary in IT Software Development.', '', ''),
(397, '2025-08-20', 'Learning and discussing more of the official Scrum Guide and the principles and practises of Agile Software Development, Learning more about Nexus and how multiple teams can work together on one product, Learning more of Kanban and how these Workflow methods can help to get the work done, Doing open Assessments together and discussing the reasons for the correct answers, Learning special vocabulary for Agile Software Development and Programming, Emerging Achitecture and Testing methods.', '', ''),
(397, '2025-08-21', 'Learning and discussing more of the official Nexus Guide and multiple teams work on one software product, Nexus Intergration Team accountabllities, How dependencies between Scrum Teams themselves and between different Product Backlog Items themselves causes mismatches in Product Structure and Communication across the Nexus Scrum Teams, Reducing dependencies, Facilitating communication across Teams to reduce delay and promote better coordination to deliver intergrated Software at every Sprint.', '', ''),
(397, '2025-08-22', 'More Learning of Scrum with Kanban, How Kanban can enhance the workflow in Scrum Sprints, WIP Limits (Work-in-Progress), Littles''s Law, SLE (Service Level Expectations), Definition of Workflow. Später danach, Klausuren. ', '', ''),
