(444, '2025-09-08', 'Einführung in InDesign. Philosophie des Programms, Unterschiede zu Illustrator. \nSeitenfunktion, Ausschießen, Primäre Textrahmen, Anzahl der Seiten, Musterseiten. Erweiterter Druckbogen, Zweck und Anwendung.', '', ''),
(444, '2025-09-09', 'Textfunktion in InDesign. \nTextrahmen, Zeichen- und Absatzpaletten. Variabler Charakter der Schrift.\nZeilen- und Absatzabstand. Kernig, Laufweite. \nSatzausrichtung, Korrekturen in Rausatz und Blocksatz.', '', ''),
(444, '2025-09-10', 'Absatzformate, Tabulatoren, Glyphen. Entwurf eines Falzmusters für eignes Lebenslauf. Layout des Lebenslaufs.', 'Abweichende Formate, Textkorrektur.', ''),
(444, '2025-09-11', 'Farben in InDesign (additives und subreaktives Farbsystem, Sonderfarben) definieren. \nBild in InDesign: Qualitätsmerkmales des Bildes, Bild-Import, Bildrahmen, Textumfluss.\nEntwurf eines Layouts für die eigne Bewerbung als eine achtseitige  Broschüre. ', '', ''),
(444, '2025-09-12', 'Korrektur und Ausdruck von Lebenslauf und Bewerbung.', '', ''),
(438, '2025-09-08', 'Introduction to Networking, TCP/IP Model with its Layers, PDUs, Addressing, Equipment, and Protocols, TCP-Connection-Oriented vs UDP Connection-less,  OSI Model and its Layers, the IEEE for LAN 802 and the IETF for the Internet Protocol Suite, Doing Lab Exercises together with the Command Shell, Learning to indentify MAC addresses, IPv4 Addresses, IPv6 Addresses and Port Addresses, Learning the basics of Host configuration.', '', ''),
(438, '2025-09-09', 'Ethernet and IEEE 802 LAN, chapter 2 for understanding Ethernet operation of CSMA/CD and CSMA/CA, Learning to read Frames and identifying Ethernet 2 Frames and IEEE 802.3 Frames for STP and other LLC management protocols. Using Wireshark for these tasks and doing them togehter for discussion amd SHOW + TELL, Learning MAC addresses , Security issues with Ethernet. LAN Devices and Equipment, Laerning about the IEEE.', '', ''),
(438, '2025-09-10', 'Internet Protocol v4 , chapter 3 for understanding Internet Protocol operation, Learning CLassfull Addressing in IPv4, the classes and their subnet masks, How the address numbers are calculated from the number of Bytes and Bits, Prefix/ Network portion and Suffix/ Host portion,, Calculating your Network ID with Binary ANDing  computation, Learning to read the Routing Table from the Host with the 5 reserved IP addresses, Private IP Address Range, APIPA or IETF Zero Configuration address, IANA or the Internet Assigned Numbers Authority, Doing ttasks together with Wireshark for SHOW+ TELL with discussion.', '', ''),
(438, '2025-09-11', 'Reviewing Internet Protocol v.4 , Reading all the fields of an IPv4 Packet and understanding their function with examples from Wireshark in real-time, Discussing the Security Warnings with IPv4 and its vulnerabilities, Doing the Lab Exercises for Internet Protocol v. 4, and discussing the results from Wireshark by reading tthe packets that result from the exercises, Also reading UDP Header and TCP Headers for Layer4 the Transport Layer. ', '', ''),
(438, '2025-09-12', 'For the Klausur, The Trainees had to read out loud the RFC 8200 for IPv6 and explain the meanings in the Terminology section, the Security Considerations section, and How to read and understand the fields of an IPv6 Packet as in the RFC by using real-time examples from Wireshark, and the Klausur involved using the RFC 4291 for "IP Version 6 Addressing Architecture" and the trainees explaining how to read an IPv6 address and recognizing the "Address Type Identification" : Loopback, Multicast, Link-Local unicast, Unspecified, Global Unicast, // Trainees explained an "Anycast Address". The Klausur was also review of questions from IPv4 (chapter 3) and Network Equipment (chapter 5)', '', ''),
(445, '2025-09-08', 'ArbOr: Plang, Controlling,\nZiele, Organistion,\nAufbau- u Ablauforganisation 1\nKoordination oder Kooperation?', 'Fragen, Vertiefg; IK: vgl. IL-Kurs; einige Zusatzthemen  ', '	bitte die det. Verlaufsnotierungen in der "Verlaufsseite" zum je gegenständlichen Datum im IL-Kurs beachten, iü BBB-spezifizierte Darstellungs- und Darreichungsformen, je mit ausgewerteten Ergebnissen; insbes. Voice-Chat als Präsenzelement; '),
