(564, '2025-10-20', 'Learning the principles of Agile Software Development and comparing them to Sequential Software Development with the Waterfall Model, Learning the Scrum Guide and Scrum theory of Transparency, Inspection, and Adaptation with examples, Scrum Values, Doing Scrum Open Assessments together for more understanding and discussing the reasons for the results.', '', ''),
(564, '2025-10-21', 'Learning together the the Scrum team and the reasons for Cross-Functionality and Self-Management and Teams of 10 or fewer people, the Accountabilities of the Developers, the Product Owner , and the Scrum Master and how they differ from traditional Roles and Hierarchies in Waterfall Methods, Doing the Open Assessments together and learning about Nexus and Kanban and the Product Owner and Scrum Master from these Open Assessments.', '', ''),
(564, '2025-10-22', 'Learning the components of the Sprint Events as opportunities for Inspection and Adaptation, Learning the Kanban Guide together as an addition to the Scrum framework, Practices for Workflow optimization such as Visualisation of the Workflow, Limiting the Work in Progress, and Active Management of Work Items in Progress, Doing Open Assessments for Scrum, Nexus and Kanban and discussing the reasons for the results.', '', ''),
(564, '2025-10-23', 'Learning and Reviewing the Kanban Guide, The 4 Basic Metrics of Flow, a) Work in Progress (WIP), b) Cycle Time, c) Work Item Age, and d) Throughput, The Key to Governing Flow, The Kanban Practices for flow optimization, the Scrum Events with Kanban, // Reviewing the Nexus Guide for Multiple Teams working on one project, Dependencies and Intergration Issues, Nexus Intergration Team, // Doing together Open Assessments for Kanban and Nexus, Later discussing the SPS Certification (Scaled Professional Scrum) and the PSK Certification . (Professional Scrum with Kanban)', '', ''),
(564, '2025-10-24', 'Reviewing more of the Nexus Guide for Nexus Daily Scrum, and Nexus Sprint Planning and Nexus Intergration Team, Later the Klausur / the Scrum Test , the Kanban Test , and the Nexus Test.', '', ''),
