(807, '2026-01-05', 'Introducing yourself\nDiagnostics test.\nPresent tenses and exercises.\nTable of Present, Past and Future forms.\nPositive, negative and interrogative forms and exercises.\nCapitalization rules and exercises.', 'Written opinion essay on: Being competitive.', ''),
(807, '2026-01-06', 'Genetive form and exercises.\nReading comprehension essay and exercises: Retirement age in Germany.\nPast tenses and exercises.\nTable of irregular verbs.\nUseful phrases for writing emails and business letters.\nBusiness email exercise.\nArticles and exercises.', 'Written opinion essay on: What makes people successful in the workplace.', ''),
(807, '2026-01-07', 'Personal and possessive pronouns and exercises.\nDemonstrative pronouns and exercises.\nIndefinite pronouns and exercises.\nReading comprehension essay and exercises: Cross-cultural differences in business.\nBusiness email exercise.\nComparative and superlative adjectives and exercises.', 'Written opinion essay on: Consumerism.', ''),
